## 17. Entitlements / Module Access

Commercial feature access and user authorization are separate systems.

Always distinguish:

```text
Entitlement = organization has access to the module
Permission = user is allowed to use the module
```

Never implement feature gates with pricing-plan names.

Bad:

```ts
if (plan === "pro") ...
```

Preferred:

```ts
await requireEntitlement(ctx, "AI_SALES_AGENT");
await requirePermission(ctx, "ai.manage");
```

Rules:

- Feature keys must be stable internal identifiers.
- Billing logic must not leak into domain modules.
- UI hiding is not sufficient; server-side entitlement enforcement is required.
- Tenant admins may configure user permissions but may not grant commercial entitlements.
- Platform-controlled entitlement changes must be auditable.
- Trial/expiration logic must fail closed.
- AI usage limits must be enforceable server-side.
